"cacheReadInputTokens\":0,\"cacheCreationInputTokens\":0,\"webSearchRequests\":0,\"costUSD\":0.000867,\"contextWindow\":200000,\"maxOutputTokens\":32000,\"canonicalModel\":\"claude-haiku-4-5\",\"provider\":\"firstParty\"},\"claude-sonnet-5\":{\"inputTokens\":50,\"outputTokens\":6115,\"cacheReadInputTokens\":911105,\"cacheCreationInputTokens\":26602,\"webSearchRequests\":0,\"costUSD\":0.5248185,\"contextWindow\":1000000,\"maxOutputTokens\":64000,\"canonicalModel\":\"claude-sonnet-5\",\"provider\":\"firstParty\"}},\"permission_denials\":[],\"terminal_reason\":\"completed\",\"fast_mode_state\":\"off\",\"fast_mode_disabled_reason\":\"sdk_opt_in_required\",\"subtype\":\"success\",\"api_error_status\":null,\"result\":\"## Summary\\n\\nFixed a priority bug in `checkpointBranchDestinations.BranchesFor` in `internal/cli/export.go`. The function decides which folder a checkpoint's transcript is exported under. It was checking the checkpoint's originally-recorded metadata branch first and returning immediately if non-empty \u2014 only consulting `DefaultCheckpointIDs` (checkpoints reachable from the default branch's history, computed in `buildCheckpointBranchDestinations`) when no metadata branch was recorded. This meant a checkpoint recorded on a feature branch that has since been merged into the default branch kept being filed under the old feature-branch folder.\\n\\nThe fix reverses the priority: check default-branch reachability first, and only fall back to the recorded metadata branch when the checkpoint isn't reachable from the default branch. `SourceBranch` (already tracked separately from `Branch`) continues to preserve the original branch the checkpoint was recorded on, so provenance isn't lost.\\n\\nValidation:\\n- `go build ./...` \u2014 passed\\n- `go test ./internal/cli/... -run 'Export|Branch|Snapshot'` \u2014 passed\\n- `go test ./internal/cli/... -run 'TestExport|TestSnapshotMetadata|TestBuildBranchDirectories|TestBuildCheckpointBranchDestinations'` \u2014 passed\\n- `go test ./internal/cli/...` (full package) \u2014 passed\\n\\nNo test files, `go.mod`, or `go.sum` were modified; no commits were made.\",\"ttft_ms\":1331,\"ttft_stream_ms\":739,\"time_to_request_ms\":11,\"type\":\"result\",\"duration_ms\":273925,\"uuid\":\"0ecf297c-b19b-446e-9b39-6587ae733e1d\"}\n",
